        OmniSight is a multi-engine intelligence platform powered by the NexIntel AI engine. 
        It unifies government contracts, market data, crypto flows, consumer trends, macro indicators, 
        and liquidity analytics to deliver real-time predictions, high-confidence alerts, and risk-aware insights.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#beta" class="btn primary">Join Beta</a>
        <a href="#demo" class="btn secondary">View Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section" id="overview">
      <h3>What is OmniSight?</h3>
      <p>
        OmniSight is a professional-grade meta-engine platform that ingests multi-source data, 
        transforms it into features, runs the NexIntel AI engine for predictions, and applies 
        optimization and risk controls before surfacing actionable alerts.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="engines">
      <h3>Integrated Engines</h3>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Govgistics Engine</h4>
          <p>Government contracts, awards, and sector impact signals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Money Max Engine</h4>
          <p>Cash-flow, debt, interest, and liquidity windows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Coinbase Engine</h4>
          <p>Live crypto prices, order books, and flow pressure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Amazon & eBay Engines</h4>
          <p>Consumer demand, pricing, and scarcity indicators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Macro Engine</h4>
          <p>GDP, inflation, war risk, rates, and unemployment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>On-Chain Engine</h4>
          <p>Whale movements, exchange flows, and liquidity stress.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="nexintel">
      <h3>NexIntel — The Core AI Engine</h3>
      <p>
        NexIntel performs regime detection, probability modeling, scenario analysis, 
        and ensemble learning across all engines to produce high/low zone predictions, 
        trend reversals, sector rotations, and liquidity waves.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="risk">
      <h3>Optimization & Risk Management</h3>
      <p>
        OmniSight converts NexIntel’s predictions into recommended actions (buy, sell, hold, resize) 
        and passes them through strict risk, liquidity, Money Max, and macro filters before they become alerts.
      </p>
    </section>

